Dear ENSIA Student,
I have some fantastic news to share! We have secured an exclusive discount from Limitless Learning for their upcoming Python + Data Science Bootcamp. This is a remarkable opportunity for us to enhance our skills at a significantly reduced cost.

Limitless Learning's announcement states, "At Limitless Learning, we offer a learning path that takes you from beginner to expert. Our instructor, Sofiane Ouaari, recommends starting with Python programming to ensure everyone is aligned before delving into more complex concepts in Data Science and Machine Learning. The Python course begins in January 2024, lasting four weeks with sessions twice a week, followed by the Data Science course in February 2024."

Here's the exciting part – the discounts:

● Regular price for one course: 29,900 DZD
● Regular price for any two-course combo: 40,000 DZD
ENSIA students’ exclusive offers:

● 50% off for groups of 10+: One course for 14,900 DZD, any two-course combo for 20,000 DZD
● 66% off for groups of 20+: One course for 9,900 DZD, any two-course combo for 13,300 DZD

○ Remember, this offer ends on December 31st.

This discount extends to other courses like conversational English, cybersecurity, IELTS exam prep, and more. It's an exceptional offer available only to ENSIA members.

To facilitate coordination, I have created a Google Form for interested individuals to add their information. This will help us organize the group and ensure we maximize this opportunity.

Here is the link of Google Form : https://forms.gle/7YKd4hJ3wqwz9mDfA

Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns contact me via email (houssam-eddine.boukhalfa@ensia.edu.dz). Don't miss out on this fantastic opportunity to advance your skills at an unbeatable price!

For more details check the web site : www.limitlesslearning.us

Thank you,</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2023-12-19,18:44:30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.mar1one</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Free month discord nitro for who's interested

