ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:32:08</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">@everyone 
Urgent Mobilization Call for ENSIA Students!

Dear ENSIA Community,

We are facing pressing challenges that demand our immediate action:

1- Absence of a Master's Degree: It's profoundly concerning that ENSIA does not offer a Master's degree  This is a critical pathway for our academic advancement and professional development. The availability of a Master's degree is essential for those of us aspiring to higher levels of expertise and career opportunities.(PhD)

2- The issue of inadequate internship opportunities needs to be addressed. Quality internships are vital for practical learning and career readiness.

3- Lack of Necessary Educational Tools: In this digital era, it's crucial to have access to tools like iPads or laptops for our educational pursuits. These tools are not luxuries but necessities for a comprehensive and modern learning experience.

4- Poor Quality of Curriculum: The courses we are currently being offered (such as web, network, stochastic) do not align with our educational needs and aspirations. We deserve a curriculum that is relevant, and beneficial for our future careers.

5- Unprofessional Conduct and Treatment: We are also confronted with the unprofessional behavior and disrespectful treatment from Tarek Madkour ("this is my school"). This negatively impacts our learning environment and is unacceptable in an educational setting.

We propose a peaceful strike to advocate for these fundamental needs. This is a call to come together, to voice our concerns, and to demand the educational standards we rightfully deserve.

Let's spread this message, engage in constructive dialogue, and strategize our collective actions. It's time for our voices to be heard and our educational needs to be met.

Let's come together to plan our steps forward. Our education, dignity, and future are at stake.

Together for a Better Future at ENSIA,</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:32:26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li 3ando sabeb wahdokher ygoli</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:33:08</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">__abderrahim__</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">[Your name]</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:33:58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">__abderrahim__</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">matez3afch a Houssem</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:34:53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">bakingcookiessince1969</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bla mannsaw beli the existence of mert remita is a pressing issue</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:35:11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">__abderrahim__</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">l exams ma yet3awdouch koun ma tjibch chahadat wafat, zid hadhi thani</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-01-30,22:36:54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">_larbi</Data></Cell><Cell><