وقفنا الصباح بزايد علاه نزيدو لعشية</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">anais2784#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,13:40:00</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b.lina</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sahitou koul wahed wach ygheni</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,13:41:33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deleted User</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0000</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7ta tdirouha msgma mnb3d nahadrou 😂</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">muohanned#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,13:41:44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b.lina</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.sanssoucis#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,13:42:32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b.lina</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bonne sieste everybody</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,13:43:09</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">mimi.i0844</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">فهميني وش راكي باغية كيعاد ماقدرتش نفهم وين راكي حابة توصلي</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">b.lina#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,19:56:09</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ayoubkorichi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ma3labalich ida remarkito mais l'environnement taena wla toxic makanch kima hak, mais lately aw ghir yefzed.
 malkom a khawti 😂, bqalna 3am w kol wahed yroh fi triqo sma at least we leave good memories machi a toxic environment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,20:27:53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">._mohammed5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#ayoub_za3im</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ayoubkorichi#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,21:17:10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">suumia8080</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">m seeing bli lecole made it toxic 9bel students -.-</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ayoubkorichi#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-06,21:18:30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ayoubkorichi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One of the reasons sah 😂</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">suumia8080#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:04:12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yes, I perfectly agree. I feel like the school has been turning the environment very toxic over the last couple of years.
In large universities, they care about the mental and environmental aspect as much as they care about the quality of the content provided. You always find them promoting themselves as having "inclusive environments" that allow everyone to share their ideas and grow. They understand how much this aspect is important for the growth and success of their students. You also find them support students to engage in other cultural and sport activities besides study.
When I went to NYUAD, I noticed that they put Basketball courts just below the library, and a couple of billiard tables just next to it in a nice open space. They also had a some sort of a green space in front of the classrooms that is completely isolated from the inside.
Our school neglects this aspect entirely, or at least, doesn't give it the attention it should.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">suumia8080#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:05:00</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nonetheless, we shouldn't just keep blaming the school and make things worse. If the school is not providing that supportive environment, then we should create it. We should be supporting each other and creating that friendly atmosphere that allows everyone to grow.
When I went to NYUAD, I also noticed something that made me smile for a moment. The students there prepared some cute posters with a list of questions like "Did you have breakfast today? Are you having enough sleep? Did you do something today that you enjoy?" and at the end of the posters they included the contact of their university's counseling office. Such small initiatives can make a difference!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:06:07</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As Ayoub mentioned, b9alna 3ame wkol wa7ade yro7e ftri9o, so let's try to keep nice memories out of it :).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:12:47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">muohanned</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">meanwhile in our school, we laugh about creating a Sports and entertainment club (thats a very basic example, let alone others)
so in my opinion, the problem did not only start from the school, it started within us as well</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:14:19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It didn't start from us nor from the school. It's a general problem that arises from our society's culture that neglects these aspects.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">muohanned#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,02:16:11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">muohanned</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">our known as "culture" is just us, because nowadays the independent thinking of being free evolved letting each one define them own custom "culture"</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,07:18:28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">suumia8080</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">hada lazm ychufou lbachir and medkour 🥹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">farouk2787#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2024-05-07,11:31:30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">frog3526</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">#0</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">"no posters allowed in the school"
